---
config:
  theme: redux
description: one representative usecase diagram in the redux theme, actor kinds, a rect and a package boundary, ellipse, rect and business use cases, stereotypes, association, include, extend and generalization, a note and a JSON table
---
usecase-beta
  direction LR
  actor Customer <<Human>>
  actor Clerk@{ business: true }
  actor Gateway@{ type: hollow }
  systemBoundary "Web shop"
    Browse("Browse catalogue")
    Checkout("Check out") <<Core>>
    Pay[Pay by card]
    Coupon("Apply coupon")
  end
  "Web shop"@{ type: package }
  systemBoundary "Back office"
    Refund("Refund order")@{ business: true }
  end
  Customer --> Browse
  Customer --> Checkout
  Checkout ..> : include Pay
  Coupon ..> : extend Checkout
  Clerk --> Refund
  Pay --- Gateway
  Clerk --|> Customer
  note for Clerk "Works in the back office"
  json Order@{ "id": 42, "items": ["book", "pen"] }
  Refund --> Order
